        (AdicCompletion (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal C) C)),
      Irreducible (algebraMap C (AdicCompletion (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal C) C) ϖ) ∧
      (∀ (n : ℕ) (c : C), algebraMap C (AdicCompletion (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal C) C) c ∈
